= Academic Services

== Workshop Organized:
- (Lead Organizer and speaker) "Principles of Risk Quantification in Networked Control Systems" at the 2023 American Control Conference (ACC) on 5/30/2023, please find more information at https://wordpress.lehigh.edu/robotics/acc23_risk_workshop/. Co-organized with Nader Motee.

== Invited Sessions organized
- (Lead Organizer and co-chair) Invited Session "Risk-Aware Design and Control" at the 2023 American Control Conference (ACC). Co-organized with Christoforos Somarakis and Nader Motee.

- (Lead Organizer) Invited Session "Risk-Aware Design and Control" at the 2024 American Control Conference (ACC). Co-organized with Margaret P Chapman, Peyman Mohajerin Esfahani, and Nader Motee.

- (Lead Organizer) Invited Session "Autonomous Planning and Control" at the 2024 American Control Conference (ACC). Co-organized with Fumin Zhang, Ufuk Topcu, and Nader Motee.

- (Lead Organizer and co-chair) Invited Session "Autonomous Risk-Aware Perception, Planning, and Control" at the 2025 American Control Conference (ACC). Co-organized with Michael M. Zavlanos, Ufuk Topcu, and Nader Motee.

- (Lead Organizer and co-chair) Invited Session "Autonomous Risk-Aware Perception, Planning, and Control" at the 2025 American Control Conference (ACC). Co-organized with Michael M. Zavlanos, Ufuk Topcu, and Nader Motee.

